WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.800
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:08.760
You're always wagging your
tail to those greater than you!

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.340
Always swept along with whatever's
happening! You drive me nuts!

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:14.610
Say whatever you wish.

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:19.070
But let me make this clear.
I came here on my own free will.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.150
Hey!

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:28.350
If my brother's not leaving,
then I'll simply leave.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.620
Wait! Or rather, wait, please.

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:35.730
Yuki Aiba. You are an operator
of the Vital Guarder.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.030
I'd like for you to cooperate with us so
that the Ryvius's safety can be maintained.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:44.530
This is the wish of Zwei...!
And my own wish.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.870
You... You're making me puke!

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.340
Brat.

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:51.700
If you don't wanna be called that,
then you know the right thing to do.

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:53.340
Please.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.730
Why do I hafta put up with this?

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:17.170
Infinite Ryvius

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:24.710
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:28.720
Although loneliness...

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:33.050
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:40.290
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:45.370
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:48.340
...and hurt by others as well

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:55.870
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:59.650
...the dream and the reality...

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:03.280
...that you saw cross paths

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:06.980
Some light is shed...

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:11.560
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:18.800
...so that we can go to a different place

00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:26.800
The things I want have no shape

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:35.210
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:49.330
Free Order

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:53.320
So the Blue Impulse has been defeated.

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:57.740
I hear it'll be six months before
the Vaia will be fully repaired.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:01.300
But our bigger problem is
the destruction of Hyperion!

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:03.640
There's no excuse for it!

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:06.340
It's all to get our hands on
the Vaia and the Bratica!

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:09.120
If you weigh the whole solar system
against one measly satellite...

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:10.650
...there's no comparison.

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:13.640
I'm terribly sorry.
It's due to our lack of information.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:17.990
We didn't expect him to be that affected,
with 18 years of navigation experience.

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:24.020
<i>Calling on all crew. Charge.</i>
<i>Ram at full speed.</i>

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:26.970
<i>Blue Impulse will crush and</i>
<i>destroy everything in its path.</i>

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.570
<i>Turn it. Turn it and ram them.</i>

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:34.340
<i>That's right, Turn.</i>
<i>Turn and ram them!</i>

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:37.040
He's been influenced by
the close proximity of the Sphix.

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:40.140
Perhaps there was a problem having
Vaias face off against each other.

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:43.020
Dicastia alone may not be enough.

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:46.480
Gespenst is ready to sail.

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.350
The only issue is personnel.

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:51.860
We need someone who can link
with its Sphix in a short time.

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:53.190
How about that man?

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:56.690
Sure he's qualified, but he has a tendency
to let his emotions get the better of him.

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:58.190
I don't agree.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:01.360
If we worry too much about the risks,
nothing will get done!

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:03.790
Right now, we must take action!

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:10.440
Is this an obstacle between now and
the future, or a trial handed to us?

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:14.280
<i>Hey, Kelly. The relative velocity</i>
<i>from your side is way off.</i>

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:16.920
<i>Do your work properly by</i>
<i>matching it with Manuda's.</i>

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:18.090
<i>Stop complaining!</i>

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:20.150
<i>This is now the eighth</i>
<i>communication pod.</i>

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.790
<i>There's no way any territory</i>
<i>is gonna contact us.</i>

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:24.590
<i>It's mere consolation,</i>
<i>to ease our minds.</i>

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:32.500
Hey, I found it!

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.470
I haven't had anything to eat. Open up.

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:42.840
B-But...!

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.830
- Hurry up!
- Y-Yes!

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.950
Okay, we'll have food now!

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:53.890
Wait! Where are you
going with my ID card?

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:57.450
I'm just borrowing it.
I'll double your points.

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:01.460
We've been granted the position of
supervisors, so let's do things right!

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:03.830
I don't wanna spend forever
accumulating points.

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:05.930
A man's gotta go for the jackpot!

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:07.500
Yes! I'm gonna do it!

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:08.800
Emerson...!

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:15.640
You stole these, didn't you?

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.940
It's a benefit of being a supervisor.

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:27.620
<i>Why is no one coming to rescue us?</i>
<i>We shot out all those pods.</i>

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:29.820
Um, Kouji.

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:32.720
I believe it's almost training time.

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:34.560
Huh? Is it?

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:37.330
Guys with unlimited points have it easy.

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:40.370
I now work for my points
just like everyone else!

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:41.830
I can see right through your lies.

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:44.800
- Let's go, Akihiro.
- Ah, r-right.

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:53.910
Come on, Nicks. Can't he see that
I'd rather be in his position?

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:07.880
You've gotta be kidding. Why should
I hafta look after my brother?

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:10.730
Because Kouji always blunders.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:13.520
Then my brother should take
responsibility for it.

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:16.940
Wh-What is it?

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:19.130
Why can't you be a little
more mild-mannered?

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:20.410
Wha...!

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:22.380
- We'd better hurry.
- Y-Yeah.

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:24.650
I'm sorry.

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.350
N-No. I should be the one
apologizing for being so nosy.

00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:29.250
- Goodbye.
- B-Bye.

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:35.050
That person's Aoi Housen, right?

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:37.550
- So?
- Oh, nothing.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:52.470
That girl...!

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:03.980
This way!

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:07.150
I saw some strange guy.

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:09.150
I hope it's not a ghost.

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:12.250
You're a supervisor, right?
This is part of your job.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:18.430
We don't have enough people.
Bring Gran back. Or even Charlie will do.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.090
But can we get everyone's approval?

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:22.890
We just won't tell anyone.

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:26.590
Captain. The security device in
section 57 still hasn't been repaired.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.280
Carabona. Which ground
crew sections are free?

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:31.180
There's no such thing!

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:34.610
The overall maintenance efficiency
has dropped by 30 percent as it is!

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:37.440
We'd better do something to motivate
everyone, or else we'll be in trouble.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:38.850
You're right.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.250
Maybe we outta throw those
neglecting their duties into cells.

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:42.410
But that won't...!

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:47.490
I just received information that
Airs Blue was seen in section 92.

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:49.400
H-Has he been caught?

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.190
I believe that's, "Did we catch him?"

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:52.500
And?

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:55.960
Only that he was seen. What shall we do?

00:07:56.600 --> 00:08:00.440
G-Get a statement from the witness and
prepare a report on the observation.

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:01.700
Very well.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.200
I want every little
detail recorded... please.

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:11.640
Unless you take a firm stance,
the others will begin wavering.

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:13.640
Then why can't you take over?

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:17.820
I'm the advisory type.
I'm not capable of leading people.

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:37.780
Damn it. Damn it. Damn it.

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:41.040
Damn it. Damn it. Damn it.

00:08:46.390 --> 00:08:49.190
- How does it look?
- Yeah, it looks great on you.

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:51.920
Really? Thank you, big brother.

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:54.750
You know, I'm really
fond of you, big brother.

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:57.160
Y-Yeah? I-Is that so.

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:00.700
What?

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:04.000
Why should we have to wash
all these dishes alone?

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:07.140
You're the girlfriend of a guy
with special status, right?

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:09.870
You're having more fun, so naturally,
you should do more work, too, right?

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:11.180
Right.

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:13.910
I can't stand their sly attitude.

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:15.940
Don't let it bother you.

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:25.820
Umm, she says she wants to
talk to you about something.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.290
A pleasure to meet you.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:31.930
I'm Faina S. Shinozaki. Just call me Faina.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:34.200
Welcome.

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:50.280
Phew. We're done. We're done.

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:55.560
Let's go, Kouji.

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:57.020
I've gotta fill out a report first, so...!

00:09:58.190 --> 00:09:59.590
Okay. See ya later.

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:03.190
You're the only one left,
so remember to lock up when you leave!

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:05.360
I know!

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:17.670
<i>How much longer must I
<i>continue living like this?</i></i>

00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:32.990
Stop acting so important.
You hardly have the skills.

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:37.130
You were one of those supervisors,
yet only you remain on Zwei's good side.

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:39.790
You piss me off, bastard.

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:00.050
I wanna see him.

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:01.550
Juli.

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:04.220
I've gotta pee.

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:07.720
I still have work to do.
Please go alone.

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:10.020
But...!

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:11.890
Then ask Lucson.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:14.260
But Lucson's so un-cool,
I don't wanna.

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:20.030
You must learn to do these
things on your own, Pat!

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:23.230
You understand, don't you?
This is such a place.

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:27.470
You can't continue to behave like a
spoiled child! Stop being selfish!

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:35.520
You're the worst.

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:45.460
She's right. I think so myself.

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:48.170
He probably dosed off.

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:48.960
That's possible.

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:52.730
Kouji. Why are you always so diligent?

00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:56.540
Huh? What is it?

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:03.210
What in the world happened here? Why?

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:09.010
Infinite Ryvius

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:13.990
Infinite Ryvius

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:25.130
It's not too serious. A slight concussion,
and three bumps on the head.

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:30.740
Thank you, Aoi, for tending to Kouji.

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:32.440
I live across the hall, after all.

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:33.880
Is that all?

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:35.380
What do you mean?

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:37.010
Don't you have any
other feelings for him?

00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:39.650
Ah, nope! None! Why should I?

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:42.490
Why do you feel the need to smile
and escape from the subject?

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:46.390
They attacked him in the dark?
What dirty tactics!

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:49.790
Many people are finding those with
unlimited point status annoying.

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:51.900
It wasn't our decision.

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:55.570
But it's a fact that it's
unpopular with some people.

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:57.830
But why take it out on only Kouji?

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:00.900
Because he's an easy target,
I bet. He looks weak.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.640
You won't believe this. Faina's here.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.310
- You're kidding.
- This could be interesting.

00:13:06.610 --> 00:13:07.850
You're being rude.

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:09.220
But I admit, I'm also interested.

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:11.270
- Me too.
- Aren't we all?

00:13:14.790 --> 00:13:16.760
Um... can I help you?

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:20.660
- What were you guys doing?
- Well, ah... you see...!

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:22.590
Kouji! Should you be up?

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:24.930
Yeah, but I still have a headache.

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:27.130
Ikumi. Shouldn't you be on your way?

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:29.860
Really? W-Well I'll be darned! B-Bye.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:31.100
Bye.

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:36.340
I'll take Rafra with me.

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:37.510
Are you sure?

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:40.410
Yes. My roommates have
offered to look after Rafra.

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:43.780
Thank you for everything.
I should do something to thank you.

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:45.620
You can buy us something
when you have the time.

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:46.590
I'd be glad to.

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:49.420
Bye.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:50.390
Yeah.

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:55.030
I'd better make my way to the Lift ship.

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:56.430
Take it easy.

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:58.090
I know.

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:16.570
Lucson Houjou here.
I've come to get Pat! Um...!

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.490
Is Juli here?

00:14:18.490 --> 00:14:20.610
She's already gone to the bridge.

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:22.120
I-I see.

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:24.480
She must be awfully busy with her work.

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:27.520
What does he see in that girl?

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:30.530
Any reaction from the vicinity of Saturn?

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:31.460
Nothing.

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:33.970
That's the eighth time today
you've asked that question.

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:35.430
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:38.360
We can continue sending
messages to Titan, right?

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:41.170
Yes, please.

00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:45.280
There's a current crossing the path
we're taking 30,000 serades ahead.

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:48.610
What shall we do? The current
is weaker if we took MM3.

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:50.180
Then we'll take that route.

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:51.720
But it'll take us farther from Dione.

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:53.320
We'll take the surest route.

00:14:53.320 --> 00:14:54.390
So which route is that?

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:56.860
Oh, and what have you decided
on recruiting workers?

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:59.060
We also still need to work out
new teams for the ground crew.

00:14:59.060 --> 00:15:01.930
Wait! I'm thinking.

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:08.590
Please look after these.

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:09.700
Okay!

00:15:12.610 --> 00:15:14.800
<i>Kouji wants to escape from his past.</i>

00:15:15.780 --> 00:15:17.180
<i>His past?</i>

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.640
<i>You and Kouji's brother are nothing...</i>

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:21.610
<i>... but people from the past as</i>
<i>far as Kouji is concerned.</i>

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:23.520
<i>What do you mean?</i>

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.050
<i>Exactly what I said.</i>

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:28.710
<i>What? Then you're saying that</i>
<i>I'm a nuisance to Kouji?</i>

00:15:29.020 --> 00:15:32.550
<i>Yes. Kouji will live</i>
<i>out his future, with me.</i>

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:37.260
<i>You're way outta line! It's not as if I've</i>
<i>known him since childhood by choice!</i>

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:44.660
Hey...!

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.970
Did you remember to set the timer?

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:48.770
OH, NO!

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:52.310
- Oh, boy...!
- Sorry.

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:58.720
I'll do it!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.610
No, I can handle it.

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:04.090
You know, it's because you're an
opportunist that you end up like that.

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:05.260
What did you say, Yuki?

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:07.520
- Here we go again.
- Yeah.

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:11.760
I'm doing the best I can!

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:14.130
You're only being swept
by the circumstances!

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:15.240
Stop it!

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:16.970
Why can't you be prepared
for the inevitable!

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:18.460
How dare you!

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:23.310
Stop waiting for nothing.
No one's gonna save us.

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:25.280
You don't know that.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:29.020
Hi!

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:31.010
- You alone?
- What a showy outfit.

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:33.780
How can you not be afraid?

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:37.790
Everyone's just doing as they please.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:40.230
The people on this ship are all fools.

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:41.760
You're asking for it!

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:44.890
You rely on that thought,
and now look at you.

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:48.390
Think about it. Is there any reason
for us to protect them? Damn!

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:50.600
Yuki!

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:52.730
We're here because we
wanna protect them, right?

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:54.470
Aoi Housen...!

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:59.770
You stay outta this. It's between me
and Mr. Self-destruct over there.

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:02.810
Yuki. Are you telling
me not to do anything?

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:05.710
Given your abilities,
that would suit you a lot better.

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:07.480
Can't I at least try?

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:09.220
Stop.

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:12.320
Trying without results is a waste!

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:14.520
Stop it.

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:17.390
Yuki!

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:21.060
What are you gonna do in your
condition, huh, big brother?

00:17:23.340 --> 00:17:24.930
A ghost?

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:26.500
You serious?

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:35.140
2-3. 2-3! That's right! Go! Yeah!

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:43.520
There goes today's dinner...!

00:17:51.660 --> 00:17:53.390
Neutrino pinger reacting!

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:56.090
I see eight silhouettes forming a ring.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:57.830
- Enemies?
- Likely.

00:17:58.440 --> 00:18:01.200
This is a fundamental formation
practiced by space fleets.

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:03.180
Are they submersible vessels?

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:06.210
They don't have a chance against our
Vital Guarder with anything like that.

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:09.150
This is better than having to face
something like that previous ship.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:11.350
Please have the Vital Guarder take off.

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:13.010
Right away.

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:17.960
You'd best just sit
there quietly and watch!

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:19.450
Stop it! He's injured!

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:20.960
<i>Lift ship, can you hear me?</i>

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:24.000
<i>Enemies, thought to be submersible</i>
<i>vessels, are approaching.</i>

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:25.790
<i>Please send out the Vital Guarder.</i>

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.470
Roger!

00:18:35.610 --> 00:18:36.400
Please.

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:40.680
Why didn't you do the dishes?

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:42.880
I did my share.

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:46.380
We're telling you to also do the
portion for using your boyfriend's ID!

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:48.320
- You're kidding, right?
- It's not fair.

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:49.990
You're the only one having it easy.

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:53.590
Ikumi said he'd fight for me,
so it's all right!

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:55.930
He's not fighting for you girls!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:57.160
What are you saying?

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:59.000
That screwed logic won't work with...!

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:03.960
You're all alive because of Ikumi!
Should you be talking to me that...?

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:09.400
Excuse me for a moment. Sorry.
Time out, strategy time.

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:19.010
You're being a complete ass, Kozue.
Ikumi's not only fighting for you.

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:21.680
You mustn't say that
you're any more special.

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:26.010
But Ikumi said that he'd protect me.
He really said that to me!

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:32.030
So right now, we must all cooperate
so we can all survive! Right?

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:34.330
But...!

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:39.800
I'm sorry! We'll do the rest!

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:41.040
Do it properly.

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:42.870
I'm not gonna do it.

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:44.600
You know, you're making
things really difficult!

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:50.340
You're pretty cute, so you might've been
forgiven in the past for being selfish.

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:53.180
You might've been just
fine with that until now.

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:57.090
But the situation's different now.
We're on the Ryvius.

00:19:57.390 --> 00:20:00.360
I don't wanna also end up
being targeted because of you!

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:03.160
But Ikumi said...!

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:06.330
There you go again completely relying
on someone else. Break out of it.

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:08.800
You wouldn't wanna end
up like Kouji, would you?

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:10.170
<i>A notice to all aboard.</i>

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:14.470
<i>We have located a fleet believed</i>
<i>to be an enemy at Sere 3, 460.</i>

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:17.400
<i>The Ryvius will now prepare</i>
<i>for a counterattack.</i>

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:21.850
<i>All who are currently working, take your</i>
<i>battle positions at once. I repeat!</i>

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:25.480
Will we be attacked
by enemies like before?

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:27.710
Father! Mother!

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:31.120
Your mother and father will
not be here to save you.

00:20:31.390 --> 00:20:35.720
Juli told me that I've gotta do
everything on my own from now on.

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:39.720
What would a little kid like you know?

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:52.740
I've calculated the estimated
position of the Black Ryvius.

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:55.110
It seems that the Einvalt
has not been activated yet.

00:20:55.620 --> 00:20:57.980
Spread out the Eynsfinas again.

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:00.050
We'll surround the Ryvius.

00:21:00.390 --> 00:21:04.120
Hurry up. You girls are barely
fast enough with the extra effort.

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:15.790
Now, why don't we try turning the current?

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:23.870
The current's suddenly changed!

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:25.910
We're gonna be swept away!

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:27.610
The gravitational field
warp is also increasing.

00:21:27.810 --> 00:21:29.280
Give me the figures!

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:32.350
What's this?

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:33.820
Are we under enemy attack?

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:40.660
The Ryvius... is being surrounded.

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:46.130
So these figures mean...!

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:48.900
We've captured them!

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:51.100
Boy, that was too easy.

00:21:57.840 --> 00:21:59.170
Crimson...!

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:05.380
Dicastia.

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:11.980
In your dry eyes...

00:22:11.980 --> 00:22:17.050
...a silhouette appears

00:22:17.050 --> 00:22:21.760
The blue colored future...

00:22:21.760 --> 00:22:28.490
...swayed and glittered

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:37.900
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:37.900 --> 00:22:46.510
...freedom out of pity

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:54.950
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:54.950 --> 00:22:58.860
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:22:58.860 --> 00:23:05.230
goodbye

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:10.020
Infinite Ryvius

00:23:10.020 --> 00:23:11.020
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: Incomprehensible

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:13.420
Next episode: Incomprehensible
People will never
comprehend one another.

00:23:13.420 --> 00:23:14.160
Next episode: Incomprehensible

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:16.590
Next episode: Incomprehensible
Yet people cannot live
without one another.

00:23:16.590 --> 00:23:17.430
Next episode: Incomprehensible

00:23:17.430 --> 00:23:20.460
Next episode: Incomprehensible
No matter how much people hurt one
another, people still seek others.

00:23:20.460 --> 00:23:21.430
Next episode: Incomprehensible

00:23:21.430 --> 00:23:24.600
Next episode: Incomprehensible
If that's a form of agony,
then everyone's in agony.

00:23:24.600 --> 00:23:25.670
Next episode: Incomprehensible

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:28.910
Next episode: Incomprehensible
Everyone continues to writhe
desperately in this agony.

00:23:28.910 --> 00:23:29.530
Next episode: Incomprehensible
